WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
A cold winter in prison

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,800
The high-pressure water cannon was directed at my body

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:08,740
When I get back to the cell, someone will come up and give me a good beating.

4
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:11,350
No matter how sad it is, I have been shocked

5
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:14,510
These are nothing at all anymore

6
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:16,310
But Sister Meng

7
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:17,980
she is dead

8
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:19,780
She's dead, Sister Meng

9
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,980
Once she lost it

10
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,660
I'm a pest

11
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,260
I can't die

12
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:31,080
Must live on her behalf

13
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,740
I have to take her place

14
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:35,140
Realize the dream of going to Erhai

15
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:48,800
only myself

16
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:50,560
I'll pay it back with myself

17
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:56,540
How about her?

18
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:59,140
Mr. Shen, who are you asking about, Jian Tong?

19
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:01,580
Where is she?

20
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:03,180
Jian Tong takes leave today

21
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,980
Go and ask her to come. Who will allow her to take leave?

22
00:01:04,980 --> 00:01:07,820
Has the five million been transferred to Mr. Shen?

23
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:09,220
Jian Tong is sick

24
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:11,420
The doctor said that no matter how late it was, the gods wouldn't be able to save her.
